# {{context|dialectal|or|informal|lang=en}} [[am|Am not]].
# {{context|dialectal|or|informal|lang=en}} [[are|Are]] [[not]], [[aren't|aren’t]]; [[is]] not, [[isn't|isn’t]]; [[am]] not.
#* '''1885''', [[w:Gilbert and Sullivan|Gilbert & Sullivan]], ''[[s:The_Mikado|The Mikado]]'':
